metal-float64 vendored code
===========================

This directory contains source files vendored from the metal-float64 project:

  Upstream:   https://github.com/philipturner/metal-float64
  Author:     Philip Turner
  License:    MIT (see LICENSE)

The vendored files are derived works of the upstream headers under the
`Sources/MetalFloat64/include/MetalFloat64/` tree:

  Defines.h        — utility attribute macros (ALWAYS_INLINE, NOINLINE, EXPORT)
  Double.h         — declares `metal_float64::float64_t` skeleton class
  Vector.h         — declares `metal_float64::vec<T, N>` template skeleton
  MetalFloat64.h   — umbrella header

Upstream attribution notice (from MetalFloat64.h):

  MetalFloat64 directly copies some code from the Metal Standard Library.
  This is the copyright notice embedded in the Metal Standard Library.
      -*- Metal -*-
      ===-- metal_stdlib ------------------------------===
      Copyright (c) 2014-2020 Apple Inc. All rights reserved
      ===------------------------------------------------===

No binary artifacts or Metal Standard Library source files are redistributed by
AdaptiveCpp; only the thin wrapper headers above are vendored.
